_10_46_09_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1e2586e96bf503dfbd4b331143a99fcb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_09_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b32e52dd67da765638e2c49730af007f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_09.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/384fefeb736e54b82cbe904ef03272a0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_10_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/33c5edad25f56706b68209bcfa40f01e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_10_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6e4ca23d53a73602b250159135529bc7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_10_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8400ccec120e1deaef544342691276d6/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_10.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/754cc76ce279739cc3eb6d4123a5e54d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_11_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9b62655d5e3ea109996a0206ab7bb843/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_11_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3df601f3ffe49c50aca943d01ff187f1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_11_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ecf80807e91a9424820724056f79a409/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_11.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a2115f0432b134d6633326325280d49a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_12_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/935d081bcd3b13117ef0f112ff7d6360/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_12_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e9398eb40670541a0fade637f824b9a8/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_12_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/658bc024a7f7434033647a22401137f3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_12.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>劉德華大談打麻雀趣事</h2>\n<p>梁詠琪談到與劉德華拍攝《嚦咕嚦咕新年財》的時候，笑指當時很怕達不到劉德華要求的標準，又問劉德華如果搞麻雀大賽想找誰，劉德華提議找王菲和劉嘉玲，笑指劉嘉玲寧願大家說她唱歌不好，都不可說她打牌不好。當聽到梁詠琪表示自己牌技差實輸，劉德華笑說：「我們打牌不是為了贏，是攞嚟誅吓佢。」</p>\n<h2>梁詠琪感謝粉絲30年支持</h2>\n<p>梁詠琪在演唱會尾段讀出送給粉絲和自己的信，除了感謝粉絲30年來的支持，也對努力了30年的自己說：「Gigi，妳已經做得好好，未來會越來越好。」全場拍掌歡呼，最後以〈你救哪一個〉為演唱會劃上句號。</p>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c7142ab2f0c0d26730a4a4bd4bf068d8/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_04_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cb353746875c73a074c92f702303b112/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_04_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/83960834a88cf5a245d1392456854a30/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_04_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d12721753518030ab63bd22e7a40dadf/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_04.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/70a240781cebdcc2f8739f7f6e36c8d5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_05_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2e811e93a631996e8f8b31ec55f585d9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_05_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1d15f435c11f725f0aa2cbe59a795211/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_05_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c7aa7e90f2d77a2a3bb69bd4d9c809af/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_05.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/417ae96995145dad9320a1581b820fe3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_10_46_06_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sth